Functional Requirements - 1. Two player game
2. Player should select symbol
3. Players takes alternate turns
4. Detect Winner
5. Detect Draw
6. N*N Board


Game
Responsible for:
starting game
switching turns
asking current player for move
checking if game ended
announcing winner


Board
Responsible for:
maintaining cells
validating move
placing symbol
checking row/column/diagonal win
checking board full


Player
Responsible for:
player info
symbol

Cell
Responsible for:
position
current symbol/value
